    "m_ObjectId": "26c71395717642288d42bde9ea86e521",
    "m_Title": "water transparency",
    "m_Content": "Transparancy is not compatible with underwater shader because transparent depth is not written in the depth texture. Even with the dither transparency it does not work because scene depth is not yet available for opaque.",
